1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,833
Deep in the woods outside Chicago, there's

2
00:00:02,843 --> 00:00:04,461
a cemetery the road forgot.

3
00:00:05,111 --> 00:00:06,997
Settlers were burying their dead here by

4
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:09,388
the 1840s, and some say earlier.

5
00:00:09,838 --> 00:00:12,735
In the 1960s, the road beside it closed.

6
00:00:12,965 --> 00:00:15,274
Then vandals came, toppling and stealing

7
00:00:15,284 --> 00:00:15,931
headstones.

8
00:00:16,481 --> 00:00:17,654
And the stories spread.

9
00:00:17,884 --> 00:00:19,602
Lights drifting between the graves.

10
00:00:19,832 --> 00:00:22,243
A farmhouse that appears, then fades away.

11
00:00:22,993 --> 00:00:26,370
In 1991, a ghost hunter's infrared photo

12
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:29,026
seemed to show a woman in an old-fashioned

13
00:00:29,036 --> 00:00:31,213
dress, sitting alone on a tombstone.

14
00:00:32,063 --> 00:00:33,942
Most of the gravestones are gone now.

15
00:00:34,172 --> 00:00:35,563
The stories never stopped.

16
00:00:36,313 --> 00:00:38,525
It's surrounded by the Rubio Woods forest

17
00:00:38,535 --> 00:00:40,923
preserve, open sunrise to sunset.

18
00:00:41,153 --> 00:00:42,576
Don't be there after dark.

19
00:00:43,226 --> 00:00:45,269
Comment your town, and it could be next.

